6#issuecomment-3984329742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116926","id":3984329742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tfAwO","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T13:15:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T15:19:23Z","body":"We've moved the Terrain3D repo to the godot-cpp 4.5 API which includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1904. It definitely helps me, however @Dj1nus is still experiencing crashes with a [build from our CI](https://github.com/TokisanGames/Terrain3D/actions/runs/22573871337). Original post updated.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3984329742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4163448361","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116926#issuecomment-4163448361","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116926","id":4163448361,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74KS4p","user":{"login":"Hrothdel","id":32814943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODE0OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32814943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel","html_url":"https://github.com/Hrothdel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hrothdel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T15:20:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T15:25:10Z","body":"This might actually be a race condition bug inside Terrain3D (at least the part that can still be reproduced). I've created a [PR](https://github.com/TokisanGames/Terrain3D/pull/963) on that repo.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4163448361/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4164625850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116926#issuecomment-4164625850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116926","id":4164625850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74OyW6","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-31T18:36:16Z","updated_at":"2026-03-31T18:36:16Z","body":"Indeed, our code is not thread safe. I understand that with the commit that changed behavior, and 4.6 in general, the editor is much more aggressive with threaded calls to _get_property_list() and _get().","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4164625850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4170049812","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116926#issuecomment-4170049812","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116926","id":4170049812,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74jekU","user":{"login":"TokisanGames","id":632766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/632766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames","html_url":"https://github.com/TokisanGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokisanGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T13:18:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T13:18:58Z","body":"I think this can be closed. @Hrothdel helped us identify and fix our issue.\n\nI don't think this is a bug or a regression anymore. What it is, is a dramatic change in behavior that now requires certain functions like _get() and _get_property_list() and others to be thread safe.\n\nThere's no mention of requiring thread safe in the Object docs. The requirement should be documented, so I'll leave it open so this can be read and addressed. \n\nPerhaps thread safety is only required by godot-cpp, but what we're doing in _get_property_list() is just reading and writing to a mutable member Dictionary, and that's doable in gdscript. So if the gdscript version is not threadsafe would that produce the same crashes we experienced? It's probable.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4170049812/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383140183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116926#issuecomment-4383140183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116926","id":4383140183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBUFpVw","user":{"login":"GreenCrowDev","id":62719360,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzE5MzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62719360?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev","html_url":"https://github.com/GreenCrowDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GreenCrowDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T21:19:05Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T21:19:05Z","body":"I had the same issue with an addon I was developing in GDScript.\nSame crashes as yours, they were generated by `_get()` and `_get_property_list()`.\nMy fix was checking if the function was not called by the main thread.\nMight not be the best solution, but worked as a quick fix after hours of investigation.\n\n```gdscript\nif not Thread.is_main_thread():\n\treturn\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383140183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]